FEELINGS FOR YOU.

386
00:14:59.065 --> 00:15:00.698
(<i> sighs</i>)

387
00:15:00.733 --> 00:15:04.035
YOU'VE... HAD FEELINGS FOR ME.

388
00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.337
YEAH? WHAT? SO? YOU
HAD FEELINGS FOR ME FIRST.

389
00:15:06.372 --> 00:15:07.705
WHOA! HUH.

390
00:15:09.875 --> 00:15:11.342
YOU KNOW ABOUT MY...?

391
00:15:11.377 --> 00:15:13.244
I MEAN. YOU KNOW I HAD...?

392
00:15:13.279 --> 00:15:15.846
YOU KNOW? YOU...

393
00:15:15.882 --> 00:15:17.415
