396
00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:24.788
CHINA.

397
00:15:24.824 --> 00:15:25.723
MEETING JULIE.

398
00:15:25.758 --> 00:15:27.525
JULIE. JULIE.

399
00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.894
THAT'S... OH. GOD.

400
00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:31.362
JULIE. JULIE.

401
00:15:31.397 --> 00:15:33.831
RIGHT. OKAY. I NEED TO LIE DOWN.

402
00:15:33.866 --> 00:15:36.667
NO. YOU KNOW. I'M
GOING TO STAND.

403
00:15:36.703 --> 00:15:38.369
I'M GOING TO STAND

404
00:15:38.404 --> 00:15:39.870
