413
00:16:04.564 --> 00:16:05.529
JULIE!

414
00:16:05.565 --> 00:16:06.831
HI. JULIE!

415
00:16:06.866 --> 00:16:08.677
Hi. honey. I've
got a cab waiting.

416
00:16:08.701 --> 00:16:11.034
