417
00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.906
WAIT. SO. YOU'RE GOING?

418
00:16:15.941 --> 00:16:17.486
WELL. OKAY. I. UH. I HAVE TO.

419
00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:19.710
