THIS RIGHT NOW.

420
00:16:19.745 --> 00:16:22.480
I MEAN. I'VE. UH... YOU
KNOW. I'VE GOT A CAB.

421
00:16:22.515 --> 00:16:23.981
I'VE GOT A GIRLFRIEND.

422
00:16:24.016 --> 00:16:25.749
I'M-I'M GOING TO GO GET A CAT.

423
00:16:25.785 --> 00:16:27.885
OKAY. OKAY.

424
00:16:30.022 --> 00:16:31.154
CAT.

425
00:16:43.269 --> 00:16:46.770
(<i> singing in Hebrew</i>)

426
00:16:46.806 --> 00:16:48.038
HEY. JOEY.

427
00:16:48.074 --> 00:16:50.174
HEY. PHEEBS.

428
00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:51.742
