431
00:17:01.321 --> 00:17:02.464
OH. THANK YOU.

432
00:17:02.488 --> 00:17:04.555
SO SCOTT ASKED ME

433
00:17:04.591 --> 00:17:07.358
TO COME OVER FOR
LUNCH TODAY. AND I DID.

434
00:17:07.394 --> 00:17:08.292
AND..?

435
00:17:08.328 --> 00:17:10.361
AND WE DID.

436
00:17:10.397 --> 00:17:11.795
ALL RIGHT. PHEEBS!

437
00:17:11.831 --> 00:17:12.796
WAY TO GO!

438
00:17:12.832 --> 00:17:13.898
YAY ME.

439
00:17:13.933 --> 00:17:16.600
