THAT I WAS GOING TO GET

446
00:17:27.246 --> 00:17:28.246
ALL. YOU KNOW. LIKE

447
00:17:28.281 --> 00:17:30.381
"OOH. IS-HE-GOING-TO-CALL-ME
THE-NEXT-DAY?"

448
00:17:30.416 --> 00:17:32.216
AND. YOU KNOW.
"WHERE-IS-THIS-GOING?"

449
00:17:32.252 --> 00:17:34.585
AND. YOU KNOW.
BLAH-BLAH-BLAH... YEAH...

450
00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.254
HE SAID HE WANTED TO HOLD OFF

451
00:17:36.289 --> 00:17:38.789
UNTIL HE WAS PREPARED
TO BE REALLY SERIOUS.

452
00:17:38.824 --> 00:17:40.724
WOW.

453
00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:43.361
YEAH. SO I SAID.
"OKAY. RELAX. PLEASE."

454
00:17:43.396 --> 00:17:44.528
YOU KNOW?

455
00:17:44.564 --> 00:17:46.063
I MEAN

456
00:17:46.098 --> 00:17:48.766
SEX<i> CAN</i> BE JUST ABOUT
TWO PEOPLE RIGHT THERE

457
00:17:48.801 --> 00:17:50.268
IN THE MOMENT. YOU KNOW.

458
00:17:50.303 --> 00:17:52.736
IF HE WANTS TO SEE
ME AGAIN. HE CAN CALL

459
00:17:52.772 --> 00:17:54.405
AND IF NOT. THAT'S FINE. TOO.

460
00:17:54.441 --> 00:17:57.475
SO AFTER A<i> LOT</i> OF TALKING...

461
00:17:59.812 --> 00:18:02.880
