463
00:18:07.353 --> 00:18:10.020
HE GOT YOU TO BEG
TO SLEEP WITH HIM.

464
00:18:10.055 --> 00:18:13.691
HE GOT YOU TO SAY HE
NEVER HAS TO CALL YOU AGAIN

465
00:18:13.726 --> 00:18:15.459
