469
00:18:31.911 --> 00:18:33.889
OOH. THIS ONE'S
CUTE. DON'T YOU THINK?

470
00:18:33.913 --> 00:18:35.379
YEAH. THIS ONE'S CUTE

471
00:18:35.415 --> 00:18:37.226
