479
00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:54.998
BUT I'VE GOT A FEELING
WE'RE GOING TO BE OKAY.

480
00:18:56.201 --> 00:18:58.168
YEAH. I KNOW. I KNOW.

481
00:18:58.203 --> 00:19:01.405
