500
00:19:32.538 --> 00:19:37.708
I MEAN. BOTH-BOTH CATS
ARE-ARE-ARE BEAUTIFUL AND. UM...

501
00:19:37.743 --> 00:19:38.876
(<i> sighs</i>)

502
00:19:38.911 --> 00:19:40.978
FUNNY AND...

503
00:19:42.649 --> 00:19:45.916
YOU KNOW. I-I'M SURE I'D
BE HAPPY WITH EITHER CAT.

504
00:19:45.951 --> 00:19:47.117
I JUST...

505
00:19:47.152 --> 00:19:48.919
WELL. DO YOU WANT TO TAKE BOTH?

506
00:19:48.954 --> 00:19:50.721
BOTH?! BOTH?!

507
00:19:50.756 --> 00:19:53.591
I CAN'T HAVE TWO CATS! I MEAN...

508
00:19:55.495 --> 00:19:58.529
JOEY'S THE KIND OF GUY
WHO COULD HAVE TWO CATS.

509
00:20:03.102 --> 00:20:04.935
GOOD NIGHT. GUNTHER.

510
00:20:12.645 --> 00:20:14.022
(<i> gasping</i>): HI.

511
00:20:14.046 --> 00:20:17.447
I DIDN'T GET A CAT.

512
00:20:17.483 --> 00:20:19.783
OH. THAT'S. UM...

513
00:20:19.819 --> 00:20:21.418
INTERESTING.

514
00:20:21.453 --> 00:20:23.431
NO. NO. IT'S NOT
INTERESTING. OKAY?

515
00:20:23.455 --> 00:20:25.400
IT'S VERY. VERY <i>NOT</i> INTERESTING.

516
00:20:25.424 --> 00:20:27.069
IT'S ACTUALLY 100% COMPLETELY

517
00:20:27.093 --> 00:20:28.704
THE OPPOSITE OF INTERESTING.

518
00:20:28.728 --> 00:20:30.193
I GOT IT. ROSS.

519
00:20:30.229 --> 00:20:31.573
YOU HAD NO RIGHT TO TELL ME

520
00:20:31.597 --> 00:20:33.108
YOU EVER HAD FEELINGS FOR ME.

521
00:20:33.132 --> 00:20:34.164
WHAT?!

522
00:20:34.199 --> 00:20:35.544
I WAS DOING GREAT WITH JULIE

523
00:20:35.568 --> 00:20:37.012
BEFORE I FOUND OUT ABOUT YOU.

524
00:20:37.036 --> 00:20:39.403
HEY. I WAS DOING GREAT
BEFORE I FOUND OUT ABOUT YOU.

525
00:20:39.439 --> 00:20:41.705
YOU THINK IT'S EASY FOR
ME TO SEE YOU WITH JULIE?

526
00:20:41.741 --> 00:20:43.986
WELL. THEN YOU SHOULD HAVE
SAID SOMETHING BEFORE I MET HER!

527
00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:45.209
I DIDN'T KNOW THEN!

528
00:20:45.245 --> 00:20:47.711
AND HOW COME YOU
NEVER SAID ANYTHING TO ME?

529
00:20:47.747 --> 00:20:49.358
THERE WAS NEVER A GOOD TIME.

530
00:20:49.382 --> 00:20:51.159
RIGHT! BECAUSE
YOU ONLY HAD A YEAR

531
00:20:51.183 --> 00:20:52.928
AND WE ONLY HUNG
OUT EVERY NIGHT.

532
00:20:52.952 --> 00:20:54.618
NOT... NOT... NOT...

533
00:20:54.654 --> 00:20:56.687
EVERY NIGHT.

534
00:20:56.722 --> 00:20:57.899
YOU KNOW

535
00:20:57.923 --> 00:20:59.801
AND-AND IT'S NOT LIKE
I DIDN'T TRY. RACHEL

536
00:20:59.825 --> 00:21:00.991
BUT THINGS GOT IN THE WAY

537
00:21:01.026 --> 00:21:02.471
YOU KNOW. LIKE-LIKE ITALIAN GUYS

538
00:21:02.495 --> 00:21:04.795
OR EX-FIANCEES

539
00:21:04.831 --> 00:21:05.963
OR. OR. OR...

540
00:21:05.998 --> 00:21:09.867
ITALIAN GUYS.

541
00:21:09.902 --> 00:21:12.436
HEY. THERE WAS<i> ONE</i>
ITALIAN GUY. OKAY?

542
00:21:12.472 --> 00:21:14.538
AND DO YOU EVEN HAVE A POINT?

543
00:21:14.574 --> 00:21:17.541
THE POINT IS I... I DON'T
NEED THIS RIGHT NOW. OKAY?

544
00:21:17.577 --> 00:21:19.488
IT'S-IT'S TOO LATE. I'M
WITH SOMEBODY ELSE.

545
00:21:19.512 --> 00:21:20.622
I'M HAPPY. THIS SHIP HAS SAILED.

546
00:21:20.646 --> 00:21:21.657
OKAY. SO WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?

547
00:21:21.681 --> 00:21:22.646
YOU CAN JUST

548
00:21:22.682 --> 00:21:23.814
SORT OF PUT AWAY FEELINGS

549
00:21:23.849 --> 00:21:26.050
OR WHATEVER THE HELL IT
WAS THAT YOU FELT FOR ME?

550
00:21:26.085 --> 00:21:27.663
HEY. I'VE BEEN DOING IT
SINCE THE NINTH GRADE.

551
00:21:27.687 --> 00:21:28.897
I'VE GOTTEN PRETTY
DAMN GOOD AT IT.

552
00:21:28.921 --> 00:21:30.231
ALL RIGHT. FINE. YOU GO AHEAD

553
00:21:30.255 --> 00:21:31.567
AND YOU DO THAT. ALL
RIGHT. ROSS? FINE. FINE.

554
00:21:31.591 --> 00:21:33.101
'CAUSE I DON'T NEED
YOUR STUPID SHIP!

555
00:21:33.125 --> 00:21:34.125
GOOD.

556
00:21:34.159 --> 00:21:35.559
GOOD.

557
00:21:35.595 --> 00:21:36.794
AND YOU KNOW WHAT?

558
00:21:36.829 --> 00:21:38.162
NOW I GOT CLOSURE!

559
00:21:42.201 --> 00:21:43.667
OH!

560
00:21:43.703 --> 00:21:46.036
(<i> frustrated sigh</i>)

561
00:21:50.309 --> 00:21:52.475
(<i> sobbing softly</i>)

562
00:22:21.574 --> 00:22:24.374
(<i> rattling door</i>)

563
00:22:30.916 --> 00:22:33.016
TRY THE BOTTOM ONE.

564
00:22:59.946 --> 00:23:03.747
MONICA. IT'S 6:30
IN THE MORNING.

565
00:23:03.783 --> 00:23:05.082
WE'RE NOT WORKING OUT.

566
00:23:05.117 --> 00:23:06.784
IT'S OVER.

567
00:23:06.819 --> 00:23:09.252
NO WAY! WITH ONE
POUND TO GO? COME ON!

568
00:23:09.288 --> 00:23:10.254
♪ WE'RE WORKING ♪

569
00:23:10.289 --> 00:23:11.254
♪ WE'RE MOVING ♪

570
00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:13.657
♪ WE'RE IN THE ZONE.
WE'RE GROOVING. ♪

571
00:23:13.693 --> 00:23:17.061
OKAY. I DON'T... I DON'T
MIND THE LAST POUND. OKAY?

572
00:23:17.096 --> 00:23:19.663
IN FACT. I KIND OF<i>
LIKE</i> THE LAST POUND.

573
00:23:19.699 --> 00:23:23.634
OKAY? SO DON'T MAKE ME
DO ANYTHING THAT I'LL REGRET.

574
00:23:23.669 --> 00:23:27.738
OH! WHAT YOU GOING
TO DO. FAT BOY? HUH?

575
00:23:27.773 --> 00:23:29.239
WHAT?

576
00:23:30.476 --> 00:23:34.277
NOTHING. EXCEPT TELL YOU.
UH. I THINK IT'S WONDERFUL

577
00:23:34.313 --> 00:23:35.512
HOW MUCH ENERGY YOU HAVE.

578
00:23:35.547 --> 00:23:36.658
WELL! THANKS.

579
00:23:36.682 --> 00:23:37.648
I MEAN

580
00:23:37.683 --> 00:23:38.949
ESPECIALLY CONSIDERING

581
00:23:38.984 --> 00:23:41.384
HOW TOUGH IT'S BEEN
FOR YOU TO FIND WORK.

582
00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:43.286
WELL. YOU KNOW. YOU...

583
00:23:43.322 --> 00:23:45.255
YOU KNOW. I MEAN

584
00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:47.658
YOU CAN'T TELL YOUR
PARENTS YOU WERE FIRED

585
00:23:47.693 --> 00:23:49.426
BECAUSE THEY'D BE DISAPPOINTED.

586
00:23:49.461 --> 00:23:52.963
UH-HUH.

587
00:23:52.998 --> 00:23:54.698
AND IT'S NOT AS IF YOU HAVE

588
00:23:54.734 --> 00:23:56.834
A BOYFRIEND'S
SHOULDER TO CRY ON.

589
00:23:56.869 --> 00:23:58.969
WELL. NO. BUT. I...

590
00:23:59.004 --> 00:24:00.304
I MEAN. IF IT WERE ME

591
00:24:00.339 --> 00:24:02.172
I THINK I'D HAVE DIFFICULTY

592
00:24:02.207 --> 00:24:04.341
JUST GETTING OUT OF BED AT ALL.

593
00:24:09.849 --> 00:24:13.416
YOU KNOW. I<i> TRY</i>
TO STAY POSITIVE.

594
00:24:13.452 --> 00:24:15.152
SO. YOU...

595
00:24:15.187 --> 00:24:18.188
YOU FEEL LIKE GOING FOR A RUN?

596
00:24:20.059 --> 00:24:22.492
ALL RIGHT.

597
00:24:22.527 --> 00:24:24.995
BECAUSE. YOU KNOW.
YOU DON'T HAVE TO.

598
00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:28.431
IF YOU WANT. YOU COULD
JUST TAKE A NAP RIGHT HERE.

599
00:24:28.467 --> 00:24:31.168
OKAY.

600
00:24:31.203 --> 00:24:33.203
JUST FOR A LITTLE WHILE.

601
00:24:33.238 --> 00:24:34.705
OKAY.

